<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>RAAHI MUSIC — Feel The Road</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--bg:#050505;--card:#101010;--line:#252525;--text:#fff;--muted:#999;--orange:#ff6a00}
body{min-height:100vh;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%,#281100 0,transparent 38%),var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
.app{width:min(1100px,100%);margin:auto;padding:22px}
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}
.logo{font-size:25px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px}.logo span{color:var(--orange)}
.badge{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:9px 13px;border-radius:20px;color:#bbb;font-size:12px}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#111,#080808);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;padding:26px;overflow:hidden}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,78px);line-height:.95;margin:40px 0 18px}.hero h1 span{color:var(--orange)}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;max-width:560px}
.cover{min-height:430px;border-radius:22px;background:url('cover.jpg') center/cover;filter:grayscale(100%);box-shadow:0 20px 60px #000}
.section-title{margin:30px 0 14px;font-size:22px}
.player{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;padding:20px}
.now{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}.thumb{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:14px;background:url('cover.jpg') center/cover;filter:grayscale(100%);flex:none}
.song-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:700}.artist{color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px}
audio{width:100%;margin-top:18px}
.note{color:#777;font-size:12px;margin-top:12px}
@media(max-width:760px){.app{padding:14px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px}.cover{min-height:390px;order:-1}.hero h1{margin:12px 0;font-size:48px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
<header><div class="logo">RAAHI <span>MUSIC</span></div><div class="badge">FEEL THE ROAD</div></header>

<section class="hero">
  <div>
    <h1>Music for the <span>Road.</span></h1>
    <p>Listen to your favourite licensed music with a clean, simple and mobile-friendly RAAHI MUSIC experience.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cover" aria-label="RAAHI MUSIC cover"></div>
</section>

<h2 class="section-title">🎵 Now Playing</h2>
<section class="player">
  <div class="now">
    <div class="thumb"></div>
    <div><div class="song-title">Your Licensed Song</div><div class="artist">RAAHI MUSIC</div></div>
  </div>
  <audio controls preload="metadata">
    <!-- Add a licensed MP3 named "song.mp3" beside this index.html -->
    <source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support audio.
  </audio>
  <div class="note">Background playback depends on the browser and phone's battery/background restrictions.</div>
</section>
</div>
</body>
</html>